	| Dossiera Project Key                   | ${staticDossieraProjectKey}                |
	| End Day                                | ${staticEndDay}                            |
	| End Month                              | ${staticEndMonth}                          |
	| End Year                               | ${staticEndYear}                           |
	| Industry                               | Automotive                                 |
	| Owner Email Address                    | prm.koroneiki2@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Owner First Name                       | PRO                                        |
	| Owner Last Name                        | Koroneiki2                                 |
	| Partner First Line Support             | false                                      |
	| Product Type                           | New                                        |
	| Product Name                           | Liferay Digital Enterprise - Prod Sizing 4 |
	| Project Name                           | Permis - ${staticProjectName}              |
	| Renewal                                | false                                      |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Key             | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey}          |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 1 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey1} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 2 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey2} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Sold By         | Liferay US                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Stage Name      | Closed Won                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Territory       | United States                              |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Type            | New Business                               |
	| Salesforce Owner User Key              | ${staticSalesforceOwnerUserKey}            |
	| Salesforce Project Key                 | ${staticSalesforceProjectKey}              |
	| Start Day                              | ${staticStartDay}                          |
	| Start Month                            | ${staticStartMonth}                        |
	| Start Year                             | ${staticStartYear}                         |
	| Subscription Level                     | Platinum                                   |
	| Version Number                         | 7.1                                        |
	And I create a note for the account "Permis - ${staticProjectName}" with the following values
	| Agent Name | Koroneiki User       |
	| Content    | Account Note Content |
	| Format     | Plain                |
	| Priority   | 1                    |
	| Status     | Approved             |
	| Type       | General              |
	And I log into the provisioning homepage as "provisioning.contact.worker@liferay.com.broken" with password "${staticProvisioningQaUserPassword}"
	And I update my password upon login to "test"
	And I go to the account index page
	And I search the accounts page using the keyword "Permis"
	And I click on the account with the name "Permis - ${staticProjectName}" on the provisioning index
	And I expand the side panel on the account details page
	And I click on the "Notes" side panel tab
	Then I should be able to view the "Pinned" type note with the content "Account Note Content" and the following values
	| Author  | Koroneiki User       |
	| Content | Account Note Content |
	And I should not be able to view the "Edit" button for the "Pinned" note with the content "Account Note Content"
	And I should not be able to view the "Unpin" button for the "Pinned" note with the content "Account Note Content"
	And I should not be able to view the dropdown menu button for the "Pinned" note with the content "Account Note Content"
	And I should not be able to view the "General" type note with the content "Account Note Content"
	And I should not be able to view the view archived notes link

Scenario: View archived note
	Testing the ability to create a platinum subcription in Dossiera and adding an archived high priority plain note and viewing the note in the provisioning account details page 

	Given I publish a project with no partner RabbitMQ message with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
	| Account Name                           | Misper - ${staticCompanyName}              |
	| Address City                           | Diamond Bar                                |
	| Address Country                        | United States                              |
	| Address Postal Code                    | 91765                                      |
	| Address Region                         | California                                 |
	| Address Street                         | 456 Fake Street                            |
