	And I should not be able to view the archived note with the content "Account Note Content"
	When I click on the view archived notes link
	Then I should be able to view the archived note with the content "Account Note Content" and the following values
	| Author  | Koroneiki User       |
	| Content | Account Note Content |
	And I should not be able to view the dropdown menu button for the archived note with the content "Account Note Content"